DDI IS A SEPARATE ISSUE
==================================================

Audit DDI, but do NOT conflate it with depth.

DDI determines:

    which direction / half the panel retracts toward

It does NOT determine:

    the projected depth of the door plane

Therefore a bad DDI can cause:

    left panel opens right instead of left
    paired panels retract toward each other incorrectly
    horizontal double doors work but vertical pairs do not

It cannot by itself explain:

    entire door plane is one cell nearer from one approach direction.

